{"chars": "Rising from the dark soil, right at the edge of the snow, stood a little cluster of flowers so white that they almost seemed to glow, like candles in the shade. Their stems were white. Their flowers were white. There was not a single speck of green anywhere, only white, as pale and smooth as porcelain, with just a tiny touch of golden yellow deep inside each blossom. Each stem held several flowers, like little hooded bells, and they all leaned close together, as if sharing a secret.", "start": [0.275, 0.275, 0.275, 0.275, 0.275, 0.275, 0.675, 0.675, 0.675, 0.675, 0.675, 0.812, 0.812, 0.812, 0.812, 0.9, 0.9, 0.9, 0.9, 0.9, 1.238, 1.238, 1.238, 1.238, 1.238, 1.625, 1.7, 1.7, 1.7, 1.7, 1.7, 1.7, 1.913, 1.913, 1.913, 1.988, 1.988, 1.988, 1.988, 2.125, 2.125, 2.125, 2.125, 2.125, 2.337, 2.337, 2.337, 2.413, 2.413, 2.413, 2.413, 2.538, 2.538, 2.538, 2.538, 2.538, 3.125, 3.225, 3.225, 3.225, 3.225, 3.225, 3.225, 3.462, 3.462, 3.513, 3.513, 3.513, 3.513, 3.513, 3.513, 3.513, 3.775, 3.775, 3.775, 3.775, 3.775, 3.775, 3.775, 3.775, 4.112, 4.112, 4.112, 4.2, 4.2, 4.2, 4.2, 4.2, 4.2, 4.2, 4.2, 4.612, 4.612, 4.612, 4.875, 4.875, 4.875, 4.875, 4.875, 4.875, 5.312, 5.312, 5.312, 5.312, 5.312, 5.438, 5.438, 5.438, 5.438, 5.438, 5.575, 5.575, 5.575, 5.575, 5.575, 5.575, 5.575, 5.925, 5.925, 5.925, 5.925, 5.925, 5.925, 5.925, 6.125, 6.125, 6.125, 6.25, 6.25, 6.25, 6.25, 6.25, 6.65, 6.75, 6.75, 6.75, 6.75, 6.75, 6.975, 6.975, 6.975, 6.975, 6.975, 6.975, 6.975, 6.975, 7.425, 7.425, 7.425, 7.513, 7.513, 7.513, 7.513, 7.638, 7.638, 7.638, 7.638, 7.638, 7.638, 8.475, 8.575, 8.575, 8.575, 8.575, 8.575, 8.575, 8.725, 8.725, 8.725, 8.725, 8.725, 8.725, 9.15, 9.15, 9.15, 9.15, 9.15, 9.275, 9.275, 9.275, 9.275, 9.275, 9.275, 9.95, 10.05, 10.05, 10.05, 10.05, 10.05, 10.05, 10.2, 10.2, 10.2, 10.2, 10.2, 10.2, 10.2, 10.2, 10.575, 10.575, 10.575, 10.575, 10.575, 10.7, 10.7, 10.7, 10.7, 10.7, 10.7, 11.35, 11.425, 11.425, 11.425, 11.425, 11.425, 11.425, 11.562, 11.562, 11.562, 11.562, 11.